---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Before & After Studio Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Before & After Studio: photos and projects, purchases, permissions, sharing, storage and deletion."
>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy / Before & After Studio</p>
    <h1>
      Privacy Policy — <em>Before & After Studio</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Effective date:</strong> November 6, 2026
      <br />
      <strong>Developer:</strong> Velvet & Pixel
      <br />
      <strong>Contact:</strong>{" "}
      <a href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">velvetandpixel@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Before & After Studio is a photo comparison and editing application. We
      designed the app to process your photos locally on your Android device
      without requiring an account or uploading your photos to our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Photos and projects</h2>
    <p>
      Photos selected for editing are imported into the application's private
      local storage. Editing, alignment, rendering, and project management take
      place on your device.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not operate a server that receives or stores your photos, projects,
      logos, or editing history.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your photos may contain metadata, including location information. Imported
      originals may retain this metadata locally. The app's generated JPEG and
      PNG exports do not intentionally copy the original photos' location
      metadata.
    </p>

    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>
      Before & After Studio offers an optional one-time Pro purchase through
      Google Play Billing.
    </p>
    <p>
      Google processes purchases and may collect information necessary for
      payment processing, purchase verification, fraud prevention, and operation
      of Google Play services.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app uses purchase information to determine whether Pro features are
      unlocked. We do not directly collect or store your payment card details.
    </p>
    <p>
      Google's handling of personal information is governed by its own privacy
      policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Permissions and network access</h2>
    <p>
      The app uses Android's system photo picker to let you select images. It
      does not request unrestricted access to your photo library.
    </p>
    <p>
      Network access is used for Google Play Billing and related services. The
      app does not require an account with Velvet & Pixel.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app does not include developer-operated advertising, analytics, or
      crash-reporting services.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing and exporting</h2>
    <p>You control when and where you save or share exported images.</p>
    <p>
      When you share an image with another application or save it to a
      cloud-connected destination, that service may process the image under its
      own privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Storage and deletion</h2>
    <p>
      Projects, imported photos, presets, and purchase-related local records are
      stored on your device.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can delete projects within the app. Uninstalling the app or clearing
      its storage removes locally stored application data, including projects
      and the local free-export allowance record.
    </p>
    <p>
      Uninstalling does not cancel or erase a completed Google Play purchase.
      Eligible purchases may be restored using the purchasing Google account.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app does not currently provide cloud backup or synchronization of
      projects.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Before & After Studio is a general-purpose creative tool and is not
      specifically designed for children. We do not knowingly operate a service
      that collects children's personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      The app uses Android's application-private storage and system-provided
      mechanisms for photo selection, saving, and sharing. No software can
      guarantee absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when the app's functionality, integrations, or
      legal requirements change. The updated effective date will appear on this
      page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, contact{" "}
      <a href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">velvetandpixel@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
